'''Renzik "The Shiv"''' is a [[goblin]] located in [[Old Town]] in [[Stormwind City]]. He is a member of the [[SI:7]] acting as [[Master Mathias Shaw]]'s second in command.<ref name="SI7">{{questlong|Alliance|16|SI:7 (quest)|SI:7|class=rogue}}</ref> Renzik has connection both to the [[Hidden Circle]] in [[Ironforge]] as well as the [[rogue]]s in [[Darnassus]].

Up-and-coming [[rogue]] [[adventurer]]s who catch the attention of [[SI:7]] are directed to meet with Renzik within the [[SI:7 (Stormwind City)|SI:7 headquarters]] in the [[Old Town]] of [[Stormwind City]].<ref name="SI7"/><ref>{{questlong|Alliance|16|Erion's Behest|class=rogue}}</ref><ref>{{questlong|Alliance|16|Kingly Shakedown|class=rogue}}</ref> He sends these recruits to [[Lucius]] in the [[Redridge Mountains]] for training, so that they wouldn't die while on missions for SI:7.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|16|Redridge Rendezvous|class=rogue}}</ref>

